		line=772,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The meeting is quickly adjourned with no decisions made, leaving the three of us alone in the headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Hotori puts on some tea, and we all take the time to catch our breath.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm sorry you had to see that, Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Under normal circumstances, I would've introduced you to everyone.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Not like you could've done anything, with the way Maki was acting.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You sure have it pretty rough, too.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Seeming to not have taken any offense, Akari cheerfully sips at her tea.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, this is good stuff.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu is very particular about it.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Apparently she 'cannot abide Hotori-sama drinking anything but the noblest of teas.'”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Frugality in all things is the first lesson we're taught, but I just can't say no to that girl.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Hotori wryly smiles to herself.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"It certainly is hard to say no to a cute puppy that gets inexplicably attached to you.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know she was pretty insistent about it, but what are you actually gonna do about Kokuan?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Hotori purposefully sets her teacup aside.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We're going to rescue him, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To all the disciples of the Myougikan, my father is still the true Executor.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If I were to forsake him, they wouldn't hesitate to turn their backs on me, and they'd be right to do so.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I hear he was truly the finest of men.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You know of Kokuan-dono?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course I do!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He's the former head of House Inou, leader of the warriors, master of the Myougikan, and founding chairman of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Akari proudly counts each title on her fingers.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let me remind you that my father still ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" the chairman of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Since we have heard no news of his death, more than a few warriors believe Kokuan-dono yet lives.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Hotori refuses to name herself head of House Inou and insists on calling herself “acting” chairman because she believes he will someday return.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“His skills with the blade are second to none.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And he is a man of great character.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I only have my memories of him from after the war, but he took good care of me.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He never compromised in matters of the blade and honor, but in everything else, he was a very kind man.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even Maki didn't ever dare talk back to Kokuan-dono.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He must sure be impressive, if he could even make the head of House Maki shut his loud mouth.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now that we've lost our spellblades, his leadership is the sort of thing we need right now to bring us back from the brink.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“My father coming back will be the light at the end of our tunnel.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We have to rescue him. No matter what.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"With this vehement declaration, Hotori downs the rest of her tea in one gulp.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Are you against it, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I'm in complete favor.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Count me in, too.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Seeing how that last meeting went, at this rate, the Sworn Blades really will fall to pieces.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If we want any shot of restoring the Empire, we need the Blades to remain united.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I recall Akari intently observing the reactions of all the warriors during the prior meeting.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"She seems to have accurately surmised the current state of the Blades based what she saw.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do we do about Maki? I can't imagine we'll be able to convince him.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki just wants my father to stay out of the picture. He's not considering the future of the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I think we can afford to ignore him for now.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"It's not like Hotori to be so overbearingly dismissive.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“House Maki and House Inou have always been at odds with each other, haven't they?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It would be more accurate to say that the Makis have always held a one-sided grudge against the Inous.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"I give Akari a rough explanation.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"The feud between House Maki and House Inou was sparked by an incident three hundred years ago.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Even then, the Three Founders were recognized by all as the triumvirate of clans which held authority over warrior society.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"The Emperor at the time was fond of displays of bladesmanship, so he decreed that the heads of the Three Founders were to face each other in an official match.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"The house heads had a long-standing tradition of avoiding such displays to prevent unnecessary conflict, but they were powerless to refuse His Majesty's decree.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"It would have been a grave insult to hold anything back in the presence of the Emperor, so each House's relative standing was laid bare for all to witness.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"House Inou displayed the most valor.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Next was House Maki.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"House Sarashina was content with third place.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"House Inou, being the clan that produced the Forefather, the common ancestor of all warriors, was already the most prestigious.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"And now, they had irrefutably upheld their reputation.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"The results of the contest were soon reflected in the number of initiates that enrolled in each House's dojo.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"More members resulted in proportionately more influence in warrior society, and as House Inou's fame soared, the gulf between the Three Founding Houses grew wider and wider.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"House Sarashina was unconcerned about rankings, but House Maki was entirely different.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"They began belligerently opposing House Inou at every opportunity.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If that's the whole reason, why not just have an annual contest in front of the Emperor each year?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nobody would be willing to officiate a match like that. Think of all the resentment they'd draw.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, now that you mention it...”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Akari rubs at her furrowed brow.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's why House Maki turned to proving themselves on the battlefield over official matches.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're always rushing in headfirst to try and win decorations in battle, even if it means ignoring their orders.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“House Maki steps out of line, House Inou reprimands them, and House Sarashina mediates between the two. It's a long-standing tradition at this point.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The three houses are often called “The Righteous House Inou,” “The Valorous House Maki,” and “The Harmonious House Sarashina,” for good reason.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So without House Sarashina, they're running even more rampant than usual.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But now, the head of House Sarashina only spends her time mediating between drunkards at Miyoshi.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If only Mutsumi-san had been here, that last meeting might have gone differently.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Even with that personality of his, Maki still usually heeds whatever Mutsumi-san says with relative obedience.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"In fact, apparently Mutsumi-san was the one who talked Maki into joining the Sworn Blades in the first place.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"She truly lived up to her House's title as the bringer of harmony.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"However, Mutsumi-san has now cast aside her blade.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If we bring my father back, Mutsumi just might come back to us as well.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's the power of Kokuan, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“My father is certainly capable of inspiring others like that.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Speaking as acting chairman, I believe his rescue is worth any sacrifice.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Hotori seems completely unwilling to yield on this matter, no matter how much Maki pushes back against her.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Even if I have to do it all on my own, I swear I'll rescue him.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Hotori's knuckles turn white as she clutches her teacup.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Calm down. You'll shatter it at this rate.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll never save him if I don't smash a few teacups along the way.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, that doesn't make any sense, you know...”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"I gingerly rescue the teacup from Hotori's clutches.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I get how determined you are, but still, how are you gonna manage it?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You'd better not tell me you're gonna rally everyone in the Sworn Blades to storm the Imperial Palace together.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"For several long minutes, the three of us silently ponder the daunting task at hand.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It would probably be best to infiltrate as a small task force.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we brought too many people, it'd be no different than an armed uprising.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Hotori nods in assent.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, do you know how wide the dungeon corridors are?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It depends on the location, but even at the widest, it'd be hard for even two people to properly fight side-by-side.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Considering the ground we'd have to cover, a group of three to four would probably be best.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"We all meet each other's eyes, seemingly arriving at the same conclusion.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Me, Soujin, and Koyuzu.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, why are you leaving me out?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's too dangerous. It's out of the question to bring our lord along.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Who's the only one here who knows all about the palace's layout?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If it's that dangerous, you'll just have to try twice as hard as usual to protect me.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fine.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"If Akari orders me to protect her, I cannot possibly refuse.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"She's managed to turn the tables on me in no time flat.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Looks like she's learned a thing or two about how to deal with me.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We'll work out the details once Koyuzu confirms the intelligence.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let's pray for her success.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's one final important matter.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Hotori looks about ready to wrap things up, so I put the brakes on that.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"She's forgetting an important detail.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We should conduct Kokuan-dono's rescue in a personal capacity, without the official sanction of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Saving our chairman has nothing to do with the Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we try to pass an official resolution, Maki will be sure to oppose it at every turn.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you two keep butting heads like what happened earlier, the Blades will be torn apart.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we're truly trying to restore the Empire, we can't afford to lose any members over this.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mmh...”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Hotori is reluctant to agree.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"She seems to be so fired up about rescuing Kokuan-dono that it's clouding her judgment.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin makes a good point.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What say you, Inou?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thinking about it, I suppose you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All right. Let's move ahead in secret.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"After some time, she finally gives her assent.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm glad you understand.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Our plan is slowly falling into place.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's a real shame we're going as far as to infiltrate the palace, and yet we're not gonna kill Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Murdering someone from the shadows is the purview of knaves and scoundrels. It's not an action befitting a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“When the time comes, we'll march in honorably through the front gates and strike Okonogi down.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If we don't, the Imperial people won't see the Sworn Blades as proud loyalists to the throne.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know. I'm just kidding.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Akari floats a wry smile at the earful that her suggestion invited from Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"When I leave the headquarters with Akari, the sun is already slinking down the horizon to the west.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Hotori decided to stay a while longer to perform some maintenance on our remaining blades.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Sworn Blades are in a rough spot.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's been like this ever since the August Incident.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd love to worry about nothing else besides my own bladesmanship, but whenever people gather, factions form, and warriors are no exception.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It sure seems like most warriors have a total one-track mind, so once you start quarreling, it's awfully hard for you to smooth things over.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Especially Hotori and Maki.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're not any different, buddy.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You aren't even that self-aware?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Akari smiles resignedly to herself.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Take good care of the Blades, alright?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If the Blades falls apart, we'll be done for before we can even get started on fulfilling our ambitions.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Our ultimate objective is the restoration of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"In order to defeat Okonogi and the Republic, we need to get every last member of the Sworn Blades on our side, no matter what.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"I'll do whatever it takes to keep the Blades united as one, for both Hotori and Akari's sake.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll do everything in my power.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Akari lightly taps me on the shoulder, her gaze brimming with expectation.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"If that's all it takes to stoke me full of motivation, I must truly be a simple man indeed.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Ahh, perhaps that's what she meant by “a one-track mind.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“By the way, is it just me, or does Maki totally have it in for you?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He was staring daggers at you, wasn't he?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Is she talking about when Maki was leaving the headquarters?",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"She's more observant than I gave her credit for.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He's been on my case for a while now.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He's probably not fond of how I keep butting in as the inspector general.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm, that wasn't really the impression I was getting from him...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not sure I follow, but I'll keep that in mind.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll probably end up getting mixed up again with Maki sooner or later.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Akari nods in agreement.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Make sure you give Inou all the support she needs.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sure she'll need your help the next time she goes at it with Maki.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Plus, you'll need to rein her back when it comes to Kokuan.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, no kidding.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I left her alone, she'd probably run off to rescue him by herself.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"I mutter half-jokingly, but Akari's face is the picture of seriousness.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You can forget all about serving me for a while, so just focus on watching over Inou to make sure she doesn't do anything stupid. Okay?”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"“I entrust Hotori... to thee─”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Suddenly, those words I heard from the master ring out loudly from the depths of my ears.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"On August 8th two years ago, as Kokuan-dono steeled himself to face the Republican Army, he left me with only those final words.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"I responded to him with a simple nod, one that contained the full depths of my devotion.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"But with or without my vow to Kokuan-dono, I would still sooner die than leave Hotori's side.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Hotori was the one who took care of me after the war. Hotori was the one who consoled me in my amnesia.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"─She was the one who made me into the man I am today.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"I'll do everything I can to overcome this crisis, if only to repay a small fraction of the debt of gratitude I owe to her.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Akari and Soujin have left the headquarters together, leaving me all alone.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"I continue sitting in silence, cradling a certain spellblade in my hands.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Its edge reflects a cold light.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Its inscription ",
{"ruby", text="Nameless Flame"},
"is Shiranui.  ",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"This is no ordinary spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"It is a legendary keenblade, an Artifact on par with\nMiyaguni's raiment.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"It is the treasured heirloom of House Inou, its wielder the rightwise Executor of the warriors' will.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Ordinarily, its edge would be wreathed in purifying flames capable of abluting even the strongest steel.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"But now, it merely shimmers with a cold light.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"I still haven't been able to invoke Shiranui's power.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm sorry, Shiranui.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But I need your power, now more than ever.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"I feel a faint warmth emanating from the depths of the blade.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"It's enough to make me believe that Shiranui is whispering back to me, in the only way that it can.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
